  "description": "Blazor wrapper for ApexMaps - interactive geographic data visualization: choropleths, proportional-symbol bubbles, markers with clustering, great-circle arcs and routes, 13 projections, a built-in geometry registry, drilldown, linked selection and PNG/SVG export.",
